        "text_position": "start"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "item_01": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What age is Voxblock suitable for?",
            "content": "<p>Our audiobooks range from picture books for 3 year olds to novels for teenagers. The player is made for children aged 3 and over, who can use it on their own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_02": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need an internet connection or an account?",
            "content": "<p>No. The player has no internet connection and nothing to set up. The stories are stored on the blocks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_03": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the player need batteries?",
            "content": "<p>No. It has a built-in rechargeable battery that gives up to 16 hours of listening. Charge it with the USB-C cable and a wall plug. <a href=\"/pages/player-guide#charging\">How to charge</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_04": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I set up my player?",
            "content": "<p>Press the play button for a second to switch it on, place a book on the player and press play. If your player has an on/off switch on the back, flip it down first. <a href=\"/pages/player-guide\">Using your player</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_05": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my child use headphones?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Plug wired headphones into the headphone socket and the speaker switches off. <a href=\"/pages/player-guide#sound\">Volume and headphones</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
