        "item_02": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will my Voxblock player last?",
            "content": "<p>The player is built from as few parts as possible, so it’s simple to repair. It has a 2-year guarantee, and we repair players for life after that. When you’re finished with it, send it back free and we’ll pass it on to another child. <a href=\"/pages/delivery-and-returns#repairs\">Repairs and reuse</a></p>"
